  // PR-ONBOARDING-FLOW-2026-08-13: a rider can cancel their own
  // pending transaction by retrying with a different amount in the
  // same 5-min idempotency window (e.g., "Change amount" on the
  // Enter Amount screen). Semantically distinct from REJECTED (admin
  // rejected the proof) and REVERSED (admin reversed a prior
  // approval) — the rider changed their mind, no admin involvement.
  CANCELLED
}

